                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course mainly introduces the important human parasites in China and around the world, including the parasitic diseases that China is currently focusing on prevention and control, the risks of imported parasitic diseases that China faces, the important tropical parasitic diseases prevalent in countries along the the Belt and Road, and new emerging parasitic diseases.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
